{
  "dom_id": "step-t5523",
  "name": "Finding a Sum or Difference of Scaled Normal Random Variables",
  "problem": "If $X_1\\sim N(\\mu_1, \\sigma_1^2)$ and $X_2\\sim N(\\mu_2, \\sigma_2^2)$ are *independent* random variables and $a$ and $b$ are constants, we have\n\n$$\naX_1+bX_2\\sim N(a\\mu_1+b\\mu_2, a^2\\sigma^2_1+b^2\\sigma^2_2).\n$$\n\nFor example, if $X_1\\sim N(2,3)$ and $X_2\\sim  N(1,4)$ are independent, then \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{X}_{1}+3{X}_{2} & ∼N(2\\cdot 2+3\\cdot 1,{2}^{2}\\cdot 3+{3}^{2}\\cdot 4) \\\\  & ∼N(4+3,4\\cdot 3+9\\cdot 4) \\\\  & ∼N(7,48),\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{X}_{1}-3{X}_{2} & ∼N(2\\cdot 2+(-3)\\cdot 1,{2}^{2}\\cdot 3+{3}^{2}\\cdot 4) \\\\  & ∼N(4-3,4\\cdot 3+9\\cdot 4) \\\\  & ∼N(1,48).\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t5523\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Finding a Sum or Difference of Scaled Normal Random Variables</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t5523\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n           